19. Bxf6 gxf6 20. Qg4+ Kh8 { Surprisingly, Karpov opted to force a draw by repetition. In a serious competition he would surely have played for (and most likely obtained) the win. } 21. Qf4 { This is a good method. } ( { The game ended: } 21. Qh5 Kg7 22. Qg4 Kh8 23. Qh5 Kg7 24. Qg4 Kh8 { ½–½ } ) 
